---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'SEO Services Birmingham | Full-Service SEO';
const description = 'Full-service SEO for Birmingham businesses including technical audits, local search, content strategy, link building, and AI search optimisation.';

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'SEO Services Birmingham',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'SEO Birmingham',
    url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk/',
  },
  areaServed: {
    '@type': 'Place',
    name: 'Birmingham, West Midlands',
  },
  serviceType: 'Search Engine Optimisation',
  description: 'Full-service SEO for Birmingham businesses including technical SEO, local SEO, content strategy, link building, and AI search optimisation.',
};

const faqData = [
  {
    question: 'How long does SEO take to show results in Birmingham?',
    answer: 'Most Birmingham businesses see measurable ranking improvements within 3 to 6 months. Competitive sectors like legal services in Colmore Business District or jewellery retail in the Jewellery Quarter may take longer due to established competitors. Local SEO improvements such as Google Business Profile optimisation often deliver results faster, sometimes within 4 to 8 weeks.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What SEO services do Birmingham businesses need most?',
    answer: 'Birmingham businesses typically benefit most from local SEO (Google Business Profile and map pack visibility), technical SEO (site speed, crawlability, and structured data), and content strategy aligned to their industry. Businesses near the Bullring or Grand Central with physical premises also need strong local citation profiles.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How much do SEO services cost in Birmingham?',
    answer: 'SEO pricing in Birmingham varies by scope and competition. Monthly retainers typically range from £500 to £3,000 for small to medium businesses. One-off SEO audits start from £300. Visit our pricing page for detailed packages tailored to Birmingham businesses.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you offer SEO for startups in the Custard Factory and Digbeth?',
    answer: 'Yes. We work with tech startups and creative businesses based in the Custard Factory, Innovation Birmingham Campus, and across Digbeth. Startup SEO focuses on building topical authority quickly, targeting long-tail keywords with lower competition, and establishing a strong technical foundation before scaling content.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is AI search optimisation and why does it matter?',
    answer: 'AI search optimisation ensures your Birmingham business gets cited by AI tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews. As more users rely on AI-generated answers, traditional rankings alone are not enough. We optimise your content structure, entity signals, and authority markers so AI systems reference your business when answering relevant queries.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you help with SEO for multiple Birmingham locations?',
    answer: 'Absolutely. We build multi-location SEO strategies for businesses operating across Birmingham, Solihull, Wolverhampton, Coventry, and the wider West Midlands. Each location gets its own optimised landing page, Google Business Profile strategy, and local citation plan.',
  },
];

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqData.map((faq) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: faq.question,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: faq.answer,
    },
  })),
};
---

<Base title={title} description={description} schema={[serviceSchema, faqSchema]}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>SEO Services Birmingham</h1>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>Quick answer:</strong> SEO Birmingham provides full-service search engine optimisation for businesses across Birmingham and the West Midlands. From technical SEO and content strategy to local search and AI search optimisation, every service is built around the commercial realities of the Birmingham market.
    </div>

    <section>
      <p>SEO services in Birmingham must account for one of the UK's most diverse and competitive business landscapes. The city's economy spans financial services in Colmore Business District, advanced manufacturing along the M42 corridor, creative industries in the Custard Factory, and thousands of independent retailers and service providers competing for local visibility. A generic SEO approach does not work here.</p>

      <p>We deliver SEO strategies that are specific to Birmingham's commercial geography, its search patterns, and the industries that drive its economy. Whether you are a solicitor competing for local pack visibility, a jeweller in the Jewellery Quarter targeting product searches, or a SaaS startup at Innovation Birmingham Campus building organic acquisition, the approach needs to match the opportunity.</p>

      <p>Every engagement starts with data. We analyse your current search visibility, audit your technical foundation, map your competitive landscape within Birmingham, and build a strategy that prioritises the actions most likely to generate revenue. No guesswork, no templated plans.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical SEO</h2>

      <p>Technical SEO is the foundation that every other optimisation sits on. If search engines cannot efficiently crawl, render, and index your site, no amount of content or links will deliver results. Birmingham businesses often underestimate this, particularly corporate sites in Colmore Business District running legacy CMS platforms and startups in the Custard Factory shipping fast without SEO infrastructure.</p>

      <p>Our <a href="/technical-seo-birmingham/">technical SEO service</a> covers site architecture, crawl budget optimisation, Core Web Vitals, structured data implementation, JavaScript rendering, internal linking, and indexation management. We audit every technical layer and fix the issues that are costing you rankings.</p>

      <p>For larger Birmingham businesses with complex sites, we provide ongoing technical SEO monitoring to catch issues before they impact performance. Migrations, redesigns, and platform changes are where most technical SEO value is won or lost.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>SEO Audits</h2>

      <p>An SEO audit is the starting point for any serious optimisation effort. Our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">comprehensive SEO audit</a> examines over 200 ranking factors across technical health, content quality, backlink profile, and competitive positioning within the Birmingham market.</p>

      <p>Every audit delivers a prioritised action plan ranked by impact and effort. You see exactly what is holding your site back and what to fix first. For businesses wanting a quick initial assessment, we also offer a <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">free SEO audit</a> that covers the critical basics and identifies your biggest opportunities.</p>

      <p>Audits are particularly valuable for Birmingham businesses that have changed agencies, rebuilt their website, or experienced a sudden drop in rankings. We find the root cause and map the recovery path.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local SEO for Birmingham Businesses</h2>

      <p>Local SEO determines whether your business appears in Google's map pack, local finder, and location-based search results. For Birmingham businesses with a physical presence, from restaurants in the Balti Triangle to professional services firms near Brindleyplace, local search visibility directly drives footfall and enquiries.</p>

      <p>Our local SEO service covers Google Business Profile optimisation, local citation building across Birmingham-specific directories, review generation strategy, local landing page creation, and NAP consistency management. We also target the Birmingham Chamber of Commerce directory and sector-specific local platforms that pass genuine authority.</p>

      <p>Birmingham's local search landscape is fragmented across distinct commercial districts. A business in Edgbaston has different local competitors to one in Sutton Coldfield. We tailor the local strategy to your specific area and the search behaviour of customers within it. Visit our <a href="/areas/">areas page</a> for full coverage details.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Content SEO and Topical Authority</h2>

      <p>Content SEO builds the topical authority that tells Google your site deserves to rank for your core subjects. For Birmingham businesses, this means creating content that demonstrates genuine expertise in your industry while naturally incorporating the local entities, terminology, and context that search engines use to understand relevance.</p>

      <p>We develop content strategies that map the full topic space around your services, identify the questions Birmingham customers are asking, and create content that answers them better than your competitors. This is not about publishing blog posts for the sake of it. Every piece has a clear role in your ranking strategy and a defined commercial purpose.</p>

      <p>Industries with strong topical depth requirements, such as financial services, healthcare, and legal, benefit most from structured content programmes. We align content with E-E-A-T requirements and build the semantic signals that Google needs to trust your site as an authority. See our <a href="/industries/">industry-specific SEO</a> page for sector details.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>AI Search Optimisation</h2>

      <p>AI search is reshaping how potential customers discover Birmingham businesses. Tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot now answer queries that previously drove clicks to websites. If your business is not cited in these AI-generated responses, you are invisible to a growing segment of your market.</p>

      <p>Our <a href="/ai-search-optimisation-birmingham/">AI search optimisation service</a> ensures your business information, expertise, and services are structured so that large language models can find, understand, and cite them. This involves entity optimisation, structured data enhancement, content formatting for AI extraction, and building the citation profiles that AI systems use to verify authority.</p>

      <p>For Birmingham businesses competing in professional services, this is becoming critical. When someone asks an AI assistant to recommend an accountant in Birmingham or find the best jeweller in the Jewellery Quarter, your business needs to be in that answer.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Link Building and Digital PR</h2>

      <p>Link building for Birmingham businesses focuses on earning authoritative, relevant backlinks from sources that search engines trust. We prioritise local citations from Birmingham directories, the Birmingham Chamber of Commerce, and West Midlands business platforms alongside industry-specific publications and digital PR opportunities.</p>

      <p>Our approach avoids the low-quality link tactics that risk penalties. Instead, we build links through genuine relationships, data-driven content that earns coverage, and strategic placements in publications relevant to your sector. For businesses targeting the NEC exhibition circuit or the Bullring retail cluster, we leverage event-based and partnership link opportunities that competitors overlook.</p>

      <p>Every link we build serves two purposes: improving your domain authority in Google and strengthening the entity signals that AI search engines use to determine which businesses to cite.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>SEO Pricing</h2>

      <p>We offer transparent, fixed-price SEO packages designed for Birmingham businesses at every stage. Whether you need a one-off audit, a focused local SEO campaign, or a full-service monthly retainer covering technical, content, and off-page optimisation, our pricing is clear from the start.</p>

      <p>Visit our <a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO pricing page</a> for detailed packages, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> for a custom quote based on your specific requirements and competitive landscape.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-top: 0;">Get Your Free SEO Audit</h2>
      <p>Find out exactly where your Birmingham business stands in search. Our free audit covers technical health, local visibility, and your biggest ranking opportunities.</p>
      <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">Request Free Audit</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqData.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
